        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**QuickSettings** by **EolnMsuk** adds **App Settings** to an eligible Home Screen app's context menu. Long-press its icon to jump to its own Settings page.\n\nOnly apps with a destination exposed by the supported native Settings adapters receive the action. Existing quick actions remain in order.\n\nEnable it in **Settings > QuickSettings**; the switch applies live. The pane includes matching light/dark artwork, manual update checks, support links, and donation options.\n\nTargets **iOS 15.0+** with separate native **RootHide**, **rootless**, and **rootful** packages. The private API baseline is sourced from iOS 15–17; package builds and device compatibility still require validation. Some built-in pages and later Settings redesigns need adapter checks.",
          "useRawFormat": false
        },
        {
